### 住宿第二阶段联调：先执行 hotel-stage1-api.http 创建酒店、房型和价格库存日历

### 用户登录
# @name userLogin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/auth/mock-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "住宿预订用户",
  "accountType": "USER"
}

### 住宿报价
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/hotel/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomTypeId": 1,
  "checkInDate": "2026-10-01",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-10-04",
  "roomCount": 1
}

### 创建住宿订单
# @name createBooking
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/hotel/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: hotel-create-20261001-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomTypeId": 1,
  "checkInDate": "2026-10-01",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-10-04",
  "roomCount": 1,
  "guestCount": 1,
  "contactName": "张三",
  "contactMobile": "13800138000",
  "estimatedArrivalTime": "18:00:00",
  "specialRequests": "安排安静楼层",
  "remark": "住宿联调订单",
  "guests": [
    {
      "name": "张三",
      "mobile": "13800138000",
      "idType": "ID_CARD",
      "idNo": "110101199001011234",
      "roomIndex": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 查询我的住宿订单
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/hotel/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 模拟在线支付（orderId 使用创建订单返回值）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/orders/1/mock-pay
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: hotel-pay-20261001-001

### 取消待支付住宿订单（reservationId 使用创建订单返回值）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/hotel/bookings/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 修改待支付住宿订单
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/hotel/bookings/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: hotel-modify-20261001-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomTypeId": 1,
  "checkInDate": "2026-10-05",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-10-07",
  "roomCount": 1,
  "guestCount": 1,
  "contactName": "张三",
  "contactMobile": "13800138000",
  "estimatedArrivalTime": "19:00:00",
  "specialRequests": "修改入住日期",
  "remark": "住宿改订",
  "guests": [
    {
      "name": "张三",
      "mobile": "13800138000",
      "idType": "ID_CARD",
      "idNo": "110101199001011234",
      "roomIndex": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 已支付订单申请退款
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/hotel/bookings/1/refund-applications
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: hotel-refund-20261001-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "行程调整"
}

### 管理员查询未处理库存预警
### 先使用 hotel-stage1-api.http 中的 adminLogin，或在此处执行管理员登录
# @name adminLogin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/auth/mock-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "住宿管理员",
  "accountType": "ADMIN"
}

### 查询预警
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/hotels/inventory-alerts?status=OPEN
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
